    order: 5,
    recap: "Lesson 10 used forecasts and advice to adjust a plan. These nine characters now compress that whole human chain: come, meet, listen, read, write, speak, and return.",
    intro: "Kanji readings belong to words, not isolated cards. 会 is あ in 会う but かい in 会社 and 会話; 聞 is き in 聞く but ぶん in 新聞. When you learn each character inside one core word, all nine can carry a real message instead of becoming nine separate drawings.",
